        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duunooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu eaweeda madeeda bea wiikajeanda, nea ghaghar gayeew, gaweay heeda bung'eeda, nea ghwaat geediga ng'andidi nisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sihita geadaah lagheaneedida nea sisheagiida ghuuta shoomanda bung'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu nea gaweay jeeda shoomanda bung'eeda ea mwadaaha musta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani duu ghahamng'eanyi aba ng'asheanjiin, hean ghamiinaada fih iyeenya aba murdeenyaawa nea gookwa hang'weaka meeng'meeng'i; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "damanda duu ghang'uda muuwda nea ghwahiiy geat googeal iheenga nyaawa ng'eanyi, gwayeesha sih saawa, “Ghwasaan anda googaseadayi siida majeek aba jeeda fuga nimeewa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oapkaada gidaghayi rukuneegwa, damanda duu gwandeewa Galilaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gideaba, Orjeeda Siida gajeayiin geatinga fuga riing'eega, ak geengoor, ak gwaduudu eaweeteaba samwagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geapkaat ng'asheagaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "biikna hooweani bea bung'eedean gaweay ghoadaw iita giinealangiga atamwanagiin ea buuneeda suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Mariya Magdalena gil, ea Yoana ea Mariya gheamata Yakobo, ea gadeemga suurja gwachi mideawean suh fuga rukusa giijasoodiga iiteaba ng'asheesuun gil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji ng'asheesu aba heanyaawa duguuga mwadaagha, ak ghanyea meamwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawuurji ng'asheega nyaawa aba heanyaawa duguuga mwadaagha, nea ghanyea mamwasa. Ng'ata ghang'eat Betaro ak ghafwach ea ghwahita heeda bung'eeda, ak ghwahiiy geaw goong'weersa jeeda, ghwadaah weageakiga sibung'dean ak ghwahit; hean ghang'eat gawa nea ghahamng'eanyi aba ng'asheega bunu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beata Emau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida gaweay fih iyeenya aba jeenyaawa gharang'i siguura Emau, nea sheageewa Yerusalemu jea ghoahiita aseeta iyeenya hiteayda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gabalooleadawa iiteaba ng'asheegiga indeareedida bunuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damani balooleadawa nea goonyeari geadiin, gawa Yesu ea gwaneekiisa ak goodeayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geedukuta gheanyanga nyaawa ea mwanala siida was. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Ng'asheespa naaha oobalooleadawi nea gooweayiin?” Ghamiinaada nea niikaroomnyi gheamamuunatka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Siyagi aba jeenyaawa, siguura Gleopa ak gwayeesha, “Neada ang'iing'i guwoosi rabascheanda nea gibwaageaw aba Yerusalemu mwanala ng'asheega sisiin aba hiji askwearjoojisu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Ng'asheespa naaha?” Geeyeesha niny, “Ng'asheega Yesuheeda Nasareti, ghayi was sibaneeda mideawa uurda sinooda ea baloolda aba madeeda ASEETA ea dea buuneesean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gidahaaktaayda ashoohoodigaasa hees ea fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida ak ghoadayda eergweaksiina miyeeda, ak geengoor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda aseasa geararji gideaba niny siichea ghoaghu Israeli gil. Gilinuut gicha askweareani ea deaba samwagu aba ng'eeta ng'eada ng'asheesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiissa gwanda gadeem bea ng'eang'deanya gwachi nung' eabeala. Weay bung'eeda sakteayda duu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea mwadaaha mustaanyi; ak ghwahidu ak gwarugu gideaba niroonyi sea malaykajeanda eesha ea majeek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara fih suuk gicha gwachi sindeawi gaweay hoowa bea bung'eedean ak ghwadaakta gidagwachi rugu gadeemgiga; nea niny ea meadaaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha saawa, “Ea fuga dasheahi, mideawa gurooruunatka hang'oonyi ak ea mamwasa eara ng'asheega ghayi rugu sibanga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mamiisiina gideaba Gristo gayghwanyas sawanadeeda ama ng'ata gawa jeeda giigheambiitaanyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'eada Musa ea sibanga sean, ak gwarukusa saawa ng'ooruutka sean bea ng'asheega badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay ea gwaneekiisa gharang'dida gwachi weayiin. Ak gwahinda geaw giligasa ghang'ata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean geemearmearani nea geeyeesha, “Shinya eendeayeena, aba gideaba niisha aseeta ak ea nihidu eaweeda.” Hean gawa jeeda gheeda ak gwandeayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida mideayeewa aba agiischoodean gageanu mukaate ak gang'usha ak ghabwanach ak ghoadaw saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwajaada gheanyanga nyaawa, deagu ghwanal gideaba niny, ama ng'ata gwarooda gheanyanga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goonyeari geat nea gwayeena, “Neada jeesingaasa ea mwayeadana beasta damandida gwachi abaloolaneasa aba naweedean, nea gang'acha iiteanya aba gidaghayi nyaah ng'ooruutka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eatng'eat damandida ak gabiikta Yerusalemu, ak ghwanyasa hoowa giika atamwanagiin nea gwandeawa giika eawoojisu mideaydooschiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayi, “Huumwa gil niduudu Ng'utamiida, geabwada niihiimsa geaw Simon!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadayda iiteaba ng'asheegiga bussa aba naweedean, ea gida siyi bwak ea ghwanalda saawa gideaba niny damanda bwanaja mukaate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwaroonyi sea ginealangaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani duu gwandeawa jeedeaba balooliin, ghamiinaada Yesu aba bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghahamng'eanyi ak ghabeal muuchi, nea ghaghay gili dea maloonghajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Ghwasaan anda ning'udeagwa muuwda, ak ghwasaan anda goonyearayi geat ng'asheesu aba jeesingeagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oong'weersiina geatingeasu ea geeshangeasu, gideaba aniini gil; oang'waanya eara saseedeanyu ak ghoadaayi; aba gideaba maloonghajeanda mandeawana saseeda ea geeka gawuurji gidoadaaktanaan ghamneawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ning'ata rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu goohiimsa geatingaaschi ea geeshangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani mii ghamwas aba hooseaneegean, nea ghahamng'eanyi nea gwayeesha saawa, “Goondeawi gichea ayaaga aba hiji?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geataw banajaneeda ghweayeanda sibeash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanu ak ghwaak aba madeanyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Suh ng'asheegeasu ghayi earukuneegwa, damanda sindeaydooscheewi, ak abeeda ng'asheega aba badaydeanyu aba jeeda deaweedeeda Musa ea sibanga ea gitaabooda Nyiigheega gajeahiit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwajaat fughareenga nyaawa ghwanal ng'ooruutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha saawa, “Nih gidaghayi sing'waarda gil gideaba Gristo gayghwanyas hang'weanidooda ak gwaduuna miyeeda eaweeteaba samwagu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gideaba duukuunooda ea samsiinda riing'eega gajeerukwiida aba gheawungaaschi, aba jeeda eemoojiga sean, ghang'eada Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea agooga goowooschi mushoodigeaba ng'asheesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula, geayeaneegwa heeleeda Bwaabwa; asi oopiidana mujiineani ea eegooneegwa uurda leabu humng'eeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu geayaat humng'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoadoabiiw ea ghoahiita ng'eanyiida Betaniya, ak gagatkat geatingaaschi ak gang'usha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani ng'ushiinean gooheeli geaw ak geetiing'da eayaat humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata gabiigu Yerusalemu nea gahoosan muuchi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goobiita jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA nea gwaduumsheesa ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.53"
            ]
          }
        }
